{"name": "SPAM", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902720/extras/2a60da05a3ef8053e6d0833b984c617b.poster.avif?t=1791392303\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902720/extras/2a60da05a3ef8053e6d0833b984c617b.webm?t=1791392303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902720/extras/2a60da05a3ef8053e6d0833b984c617b.mp4?t=1791392303\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OPEN, COLLECT, CREATE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every battle brings you closer to new unique cards and expands your arsenal. <br/>Rarities, talents, and hidden synergies: the more you play, the more combinations become available to you. <br/>Your collection evolves day by day, becomes more specialized, and ultimately defines your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902720/extras/e7c0a6012582ad5056ad2ae167450864.poster.avif?t=1791392303\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902720/extras/e7c0a6012582ad5056ad2ae167450864.webm?t=1791392303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902720/extras/e7c0a6012582ad5056ad2ae167450864.mp4?t=1791392303\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">YOUR TURN TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build the deck that will let you take on players from around the world in a highly competitive ranked ladder. <br/>Want to duel a friend? Challenge them directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902720/extras/ad85d24ad784f1d127325db562636025.poster.avif?t=1791392303\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902720/extras/ad85d24ad784f1d127325db562636025.webm?t=1791392303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902720/extras/ad85d24ad784f1d127325db562636025.mp4?t=1791392303\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE RIGHT CARD AT THE RIGHT TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once your strategy is set, it is time to battle. Several times during each match, you will have the opportunity to upgrade your cards through the Tox Shop and create incredible combos. <br/><br/><strong>Multiple ways to play, but only one goal: win!</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "SPAM is a free-to-play online turn-based combat game. Jump into dynamic battles where you\u2019ll have to adapt to your opponents and try to impose your strategy. Earn new cards through your victories and create devastating combos!!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902720/358f282fbcf43a12e08ad2dc3153d11046e2021f/header.jpg?t=1791392303", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["PvP", "Strategy", "Turn-Based Combat", "Competitive", "Multiplayer", "Creature Collector"], "developers": "Ticroco Entreprise", "publishers": "Ticroco Entreprise", "release_date": "Oct 7, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "2902720", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "7 October 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/gLD7rDBRy_g", "first_seen": 1791324000.0, "review_rank": 2}